{
  "$comment": "ADR-110 farming. Seeds/saplings (items) planted with Use become a Crop entity that grows through `stages` over growSeconds (1-hour day => most crops mature in 6-18 min, trees ~30-40 min) and then turns into the `becomes` resource node (crop_* nodes are oneShot: harvested once, may drop seeds). Crops (type crop) need tilled soil (Use a hoe). Watering (watering can, or rain) gives wateredMul for wateredSeconds; fertilizer gives fertilizerMul for fertilizerSeconds (ADR-287; elapsed simulation time). ADR-352: dung fertilizer (item dung_fertilizer, crafted from dung) shares the same fertilizerMul 1.5 — same strength, slower release — but lasts dungFertilizerSeconds (900 s, 15 min) instead of 600 s; the longer dose is stored in the same Crop.fertilizerUntilTick, so no new Crop field and the old fertilizer is untouched. tiles: allowed terrain ids (0 = unknown, always allowed). ADR-247: each plantable lists `wild` = the world-spawned resource nodes of the SAME species; a seed/sapling may only be yielded by those nodes, by its `becomes` node, or by its crop_<key> harvest (no cross-species or generic seed sources).",
